      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "Ho Kuei-ch'ing 何桂清 (T. 叢山, H. 根雲, 1816–1862), on whose account P'êng was forced to retire in 1860, became a chin-shih in 1835 and thus was P'êng's classmate. A native of Yunnan, he entered the Hanlin Academy and rose rapidly in rank.",
          "source": "eccp-3649351",
          "kind": "source-wording",
          "status": "imported"
        },
        {
